  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>"
